'quo_MEGABYTES' => '百萬位元',
'quo_INSTRUCTIONS' => 'Enter the quota with optional unit suffix of \'K\' for kilobytes, \'M\' for megabytes, \'G\' for gigabytes or \'T\' for terabytes. Entries with no suffix are assumed to be in megabytes. A setting of \'0\' for either limit disables that limit for the corresponding user.',
'quo_SOFT_VAL_MUST_BE_NUMBER' => '錯誤：寬限期必須是一個整數，單位字尾為K，M，G或T。',
'quo_HARD_VAL_MUST_BE_NUMBER' => '錯誤：絕對期限必須是一個整數，單位字尾為K，M，G或T。',
'quo_ERR_HARD_LT_SOFT' => '錯誤：絕對期限必須大於寬限期限。',
